# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your Supabase project values.
#
# The app reads these via `react-native-dotenv` (see src/constants/Supabase.ts).
# In local development (`expo start`, __DEV__ === true) the app uses the *_DEV
# values. Production builds use the non-DEV values.
#
# NOTE: The values below are the original project's *anon* (public) keys, which
# were already committed in serverless/serverless.yml. They are provided here so
# the app can boot for experimentation. If those Supabase projects are still
# alive the app will connect; if not, create a new Supabase project, run
# database.sql against it, and paste your own URL + anon key here.
#
# SECURITY: For the rebuild, these should be rotated and never committed.

